factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script says the Mekedatu dam opposition was raised 'in Namakkal district' (நாமக்கல் மாவட்டத்தில்), but the article only gives Namakkal as the dateline; the place wording is an addition, though it is arguably the dateline location.
  The slides_spec and reel_script describe the 25+ districts as farmers who 'fear', while the article says they are in fear due to dependence on Cauvery — this is consistent; no issue there.
  The reel_script attributes the Mekedatu dam request to the CM 'in a petition' and says the CM should clarify — the article says the CM should convene farmer associations and clarify; consistent.
  The reel_script omits the key fact that the Karnataka CM Shivakumar's claim is that the Supreme Court already gave permission, and that Tamil Nadu's CM should send a delegation immediately — the delegation demand is missing from the reel_script.
  The reel_script states the Tamil Nadu farmers' association head Veluswamy warned the dam would 'completely paralyse' livelihoods; the article attributes this to the statement of the Uzhavar Perunthalaivar Narayanasamy Naidu's association — the source attribution is merged/confused between two statements.
  The caption says Veluswamy 'released a statement' (அறிக்கை வெளியிட்டுள்ளார) — the article indicates he released the statement, but the reel_script/caption merge two separate leaders' demands into one sentence, mixing facts from two different statements.
